              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso anyoika bo? Dimarai kotoma oponesio kere, arai kotoma ojose, arai kotoma abeit, elimonokinio Kristo; ido alelakinit ŋin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
