              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwape emielar noi kamuno da ebe mam kerumete ileic kakirot kere, dimarai katitiŋ kere, kwana, kwape kapaarasia kere, kitopolooroi Kristo kotoma akuanaka, arai kotoma aijar, arai bo kotoma atwanare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
