        },
        {
          "text": " Konye ejautenekus korai loibusakinit Akiro Nukajokak nuka Kristo, tetere arai abuni aanyun yes, arai bo amamei, apupuni nukus ebe icasitos kotoma omoyo ediopet, iutas nepepe, ketau ediopet kanuka aiyuun naka Akiro Nukajokak, ",
          "type": "text",
